  "limitations": [
    "Static and documentary configuration acceptance only. No application acceptance or measured skill efficacy/token billing improvement.",
    "2026-11-13 Ec defaults: changed inputs invalidate dependent observations; original evidence preserved at docs/validation/scripts-defaults-20261113/prior/configuration-cohesion/evidence.json",
    "New documentary inspection reexamines changed authority/succession bytes only; original operational states and unaffected evidence references remain unchanged.",
    "2026-11-13 remediation changed bound inputs; affected observations preserved in docs/validation/complete-repair-20261113/prior/configuration-cohesion/evidence.json. No operational reacceptance inferred from linter/source cleanup.",
    "2026-11-14 bounded governance correction acceptance: AC01\u201315 reexamined against original and current preimages. No product/scanner/model effectiveness acceptance; one real-tool opt-in skip is outside these criteria. Independent final validation is recorded separately without rewriting observations.",
    "2026-11-15 log repair: changed-input observations preserved in historical_evidence and before-governance; old hashes were not renewed. No current product/governance reacceptance is inferred.",
    "Previous candidate broad attempt exit130 remains historical. Final broad regression passed 207 executions (198 distinct IDs), no skips/failures/errors, with 19006 unchanged inputs. Independent validation/broad-completion/verdict.json approves GL-07 only for bounded repair integration. Configuration AC-01..15 and native history AC-01..02 remain UNVERIFIED; full three-feature approval is not claimed. Previous envelopes retained under governance-link-repair-20261115/before/ and before-broad-completion/.",
    "2026-11-15 Bandit/complete-run repair: stale source observations preserved under bandit-repair-20261115/before-documents and historical_evidence; no prior result hashes renewed.",
    "Current bounded source/terminal/governance observation is in bandit-repair-20261115/validation/verdict-current.json. BS-04 native new-file control remains INCONCLUSIVE after aborted host approval; this does not renew broader scanner acceptance or the17 unrelated undecided feature criteria.",
    "2026-11-16: changed OSV policy/guards invalidate bound observations. See osv-acquisition-20261116 report; historical hashes retained unchanged."
  ],
